<sample title="Simple Async Request" id="intersection_simple_async_request" category_id="systems">
	<sdk_desc>
		<![CDATA[This sample demonstrates how to perform a single asynchronous intersection query based on the user's mouse cursor position in the scene. The result includes the hit point and surface normal, which are visualized in the scene, along with latency information.]]>
	</sdk_desc>
	<desc>
		<brief>
