			<p>Two custom thread types are demonstrated:</p>
							<p> - <b>InfiniteThread</b> - continuously outputs messages while running.</p>
				<p> - <b>CountedThread</b> - performs a finite number of iterations before completing.</p>
					]]>
		</brief>
	</desc>
	<tags>
