			<p>You can also take screenshots via the <i>Snap Screenshot</i> button. The captured image does not include the rendered frames, but all frame metadata (including object <i>ID</i>, name, transform, and screen coordinates of the frame) is saved to a separate <i>JSON</i> file.</p>
		]]>
		</brief>
	</desc>
	<tags>
